{"seq":1,"slug":"automated-accessibility-testing","title":"自动化无障碍测试与 axe-core","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/testing/automated-accessibility-testing","wordCount":1104,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"自动化无障碍测试与-axe-core\">自动化无障碍测试与 axe-core</h1><p>axe-core 是 Deque Systems 开发的开源无障碍测试引擎，其下载量已超过 40 亿次，是 2026 年事实上的自动化无障碍测试标准。它能自动检测约 57% 的 WCAG 违规（覆盖 80+ 条规则），零误报率是其区别于其他工具的关键特征——如果 axe 报告了一个问题，几乎可以确定存在真实的可访问性缺陷。自动化测试无法替代手动测试（另外 40-60% 的问题需要人类判断），但它守住了重复性基线检查并在每次提交时防止回归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自动化无障碍测试在测试金字塔中的位置与覆盖能力：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[无障碍测试金字塔] --&gt; B[静态分析层]&#10;    A --&gt; C[组件测试层]&#10;    A --&gt; D[集成/E2E 测试层]&#10;    A --&gt; E[手动审计层]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y / vue-a11y&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[编写时即检测]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;jest-axe / vitest-axe&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[单组件渲染后检测]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;@axe-core/playwright&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[真实浏览器 DOM 检测]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[屏幕阅读器测试]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[键盘全流程]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[认知可用性]\">graph TD\n    A[无障碍测试金字塔] --&gt; B[静态分析层]\n    A --&gt; C[组件测试层]\n    A --&gt; D[集成/E2E 测试层]\n    A --&gt; E[手动审计层]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y / vue-a11y\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[编写时即检测]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"jest-axe / vitest-axe\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[单组件渲染后检测]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"@axe-core/playwright\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[真实浏览器 DOM 检测]\n    E --&gt; E1[屏幕阅读器测试]\n    E --&gt; E2[键盘全流程]\n    E --&gt; E3[认知可用性]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试层级</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n<th>运行时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态分析</td>\n<td>eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y</td>\n<td>JSX 属性层面（缺失 alt、错误 role）</td>\n<td>编辑器实时 / pre-commit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组件测试</td>\n<td>jest-axe / vitest-axe</td>\n<td>单组件渲染 DOM</td>\n<td>单元测试 / CI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2E 测试</td>\n<td>@axe-core/playwright</td>\n<td>真实浏览器完整页面 DOM</td>\n<td>PR 检查 / CI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lighthouse</td>\n<td>Chrome Lighthouse</td>\n<td>综合评分（含性能/SEO/a11y）</td>\n<td>手动 / CI 定期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动审计</td>\n<td>NVDA/VoiceOver + 人工</td>\n<td>语义正确性 + 用户体验</td>\n<td>发版前 / 季度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"axe-core-引擎架构\">axe-core 引擎架构</h2><p>axe-core 的核心设计理念是「规则引擎」——每条规则是一个独立的检查单元，包含匹配条件（哪些 DOM 节点应被检查）和检查函数（判断通过/失败/不确定）：</p>\n<p><strong>规则执行流程：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>注入 axe-core 脚本到目标页面</li>\n<li>收集目标范围内的 DOM 节点</li>\n<li>对每个节点，运行匹配的规则集</li>\n<li>每条规则执行一组 checks（多个 check 的逻辑组合判定通过/失败）</li>\n<li>汇总结果：violations（确定违规）、passes（确定通过）、incomplete（需人工确认）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>规则标签体系：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const axeConfig = {&#10;  runOnly: {&#10;    type: &#39;tag&#39;,&#10;    values: [&#39;wcag2a&#39;, &#39;wcag2aa&#39;, &#39;wcag21a&#39;, &#39;wcag21aa&#39;, &#39;wcag22aa&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> axeConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  runOnly: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tag'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    values: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wcag2a'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wcag2aa'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wcag21a'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wcag21aa'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wcag22aa'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每条规则关联一个或多个标签（如 <code>wcag2aa</code>、<code>best-practice</code>、<code>section508</code>），可按标签筛选执行范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"playwright-axe-core-集成\">Playwright + axe-core 集成</h2><p><code>@axe-core/playwright</code> 是 2026 年最推荐的 E2E 无障碍测试方案——在真实浏览器中运行完整渲染后的 DOM 检查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { test, expect } from &#39;@playwright/test&#39;;&#10;import AxeBuilder from &#39;@axe-core/playwright&#39;;&#10;&#10;test.describe(&#39;无障碍测试&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  test(&#39;首页无 WCAG 2.2 AA 违规&#39;, async ({ page }) =&gt; {&#10;    await page.goto(&#39;/&#39;);&#10;    const results = await new AxeBuilder({ page })&#10;      .withTags([&#39;wcag2a&#39;, &#39;wcag2aa&#39;, &#39;wcag21a&#39;, &#39;wcag21aa&#39;, &#39;wcag22aa&#39;])&#10;      .analyze();&#10;&#10;    expect(results.violations).toEqual([]);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  test(&#39;登录流程各状态无违规&#39;, async ({ page }) =&gt; {&#10;    await page.goto(&#39;/login&#39;);&#10;&#10;    // 测试初始状态&#10;    let results = await new AxeBuilder({ page }).include(&#39;#login-form&#39;).analyze();&#10;    expect(results.violations).toEqual([]);&#10;&#10;    // 触发验证错误后再测试&#10;    await page.getByRole(&#39;button&#39;, { name: &#39;登录&#39; }).click();&#10;    results = await new AxeBuilder({ page }).include(&#39;#login-form&#39;).analyze();&#10;    expect(results.violations).toEqual([]);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  test(&#39;对话框打开状态无违规&#39;, async ({ page }) =&gt; {&#10;    await page.goto(&#39;/dashboard&#39;);&#10;    await page.getByRole(&#39;button&#39;, { name: &#39;新建项目&#39; }).click();&#10;&#10;    const results = await new AxeBuilder({ page }).include(&#39;[role=&quot;dialog&quot;]&#39;).analyze();&#10;    expect(results.violations).toEqual([]);&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { test, expect } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@playwright/test'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AxeBuilder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@axe-core/playwright'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">test.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'无障碍测试'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'首页无 WCAG 2.2 AA 违规'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">goto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AxeBuilder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ page })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withTags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wcag2a'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wcag2aa'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wcag21a'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wcag21aa'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shi