re class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"plugins\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"jsx-a11y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"extends\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"plugin:jsx-a11y/strict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"jsx-a11y/alt-text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"jsx-a11y/anchor-has-content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"jsx-a11y/click-events-have-key-events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"jsx-a11y/no-static-element-interactions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"jsx-a11y/label-has-associated-control\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Vue 生态对应 <code>eslint-plugin-vuejs-accessibility</code>，Angular 生态对应 <code>@angular-eslint</code> 内置的无障碍规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"axe-core-规则分类与影响级别\">axe-core 规则分类与影响级别</h2><p>axe 将违规按影响程度分为四级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>影响级别</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例规则</th>\n<th>处理策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>critical</td>\n<td>用户完全无法使用</td>\n<td>image-alt, button-name</td>\n<td>立即修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>serious</td>\n<td>严重障碍但有变通方案</td>\n<td>color-contrast, link-name</td>\n<td>PR 内修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>moderate</td>\n<td>影响体验但不阻断</td>\n<td>heading-order, region</td>\n<td>Sprint 内修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>minor</td>\n<td>最佳实践建议</td>\n<td>landmark-no-duplicate-main</td>\n<td>待规划</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>推荐门控策略：</strong> CI 中阻断 critical + serious 级别违规，moderate + minor 作为 warning 追踪但不阻断合并。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"test(&#39;无 critical/serious 级别违规&#39;, async ({ page }) =&gt; {&#10;  await page.goto(&#39;/&#39;);&#10;  const results = await new AxeBuilder({ page }).analyze();&#10;  const blockers = results.violations.filter((v) =&gt; v.impact === &#39;critical&#39; || v.impact === &#39;serious&#39;);&#10;  expect(blockers).toEqual([]);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'无 critical/serious 级别违规'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">goto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AxeBuilder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ page }).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">analyze</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> blockers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results.violations.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v.impact </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'critical'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v.impact </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'serious'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(blockers).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toEqual</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"自动化测试的局限性\">自动化测试的局限性</h2><p>axe-core 文档明确声明：自动化工具只能覆盖约 30-40% 的全部 WCAG 成功准则。以下类别<strong>无法自动检测</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>替代文本的<strong>质量</strong>（axe 能检测缺失 alt，但无法判断「图片」比「团队在白板前讨论架构方案」更差）</li>\n<li>键盘操作的<strong>逻辑正确性</strong>（Tab 顺序是否符合用户预期）</li>\n<li>内容的<strong>认知清晰度</strong>（语言是否易懂、流程是否直觉）</li>\n<li>动态交互的<strong>时序正确性</strong>（aria-live 播报是否在正确时机）</li>\n<li>辅助技术的<strong>实际兼容性</strong>（NVDA/JAWS/VoiceOver 行为差异）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这正是为什么测试篇还有「屏幕阅读器手动测试」——两者互补而非替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>axe-core 是零误报的无障碍规则引擎，覆盖约 57% 的 WCAG 违规检测</li>\n<li>测试金字塔：静态分析（eslint）→ 组件测试（jest-axe）→ E2E（@axe-core/playwright）</li>\n<li>CI 门控建议：critical + serious 阻断，moderate + minor 追踪</li>\n<li>测试交互后状态（展开、错误、加载）而非仅初始渲染</li>\n<li>自动化覆盖 30-40% 的 WCAG 准则，其余需手动审计</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章下一篇：<a href=\"screen-reader-manual-testing\">屏幕阅读器与手动测试</a>——覆盖自动化无法触达的 60% 问题</li>\n<li>跨 hub 参考：<a href=\"../../frontend-testing/integration-e2e/e2e-playwright\">前端测试 — E2E Playwright</a>——Playwright 测试基础设施搭建</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自动化无障碍测试与 axe-core","id":"自动化无障碍测试与-axe-core"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"axe-core 引擎架构","id":"axe-core-引擎架构"},{"level":2,"text":"Playwright + axe-core 集成","id":"playwright-axe-core-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"组件级测试：vitest-axe","id":"组件级测试-vitest-axe"},{"level":2,"text":"静态分析：eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y","id":"静态分析-eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y"},{"level":2,"text":"axe-core 规则分类与影响级别","id":"axe-core-规则分类与影响级别"},{"level":2,"text":"自动化测试的局限性","id":"自动化测试的局限性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"WAI-ARIA APG 组件模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/implementation/accessible-components-patterns"},"next":{"title":"屏幕阅读器与手动测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/testing/screen-reader-manual-testing"}}